;====================<WINQUOTES>====================
[Quotes]
victory0 = "Jeez... Are you the gutsy type or just someone who doesn't know when to pack it up..."
victory1 = "You're up for another round, for real? No can do, you're starting to rub off some strange habits onto me."
victory2 = "It doesn't matter how many of those weak attacks you throw at me, none of them will get the job done."
victory3 = "Don't think too deep into it. It's not as if I'm doing anything precise."
victory4 = "I can't tangle with ya' anymore. I'd have to retrain myself even more if I did."
victory5 = "You're strong, that's for sure... You were worth beating."
victory6 = "If it's training we're talking about here, I'm training till I drop everyday."
victory7 = "You overestimated your own capabilities."

;Alex
victory8 = "Well, well. It seems I've still got a ways to go yet."

;Abigail
victory9 = "You got the power. But you need a lot more skill to back it up."

;Akira Kazama
victory10 = "If you want my autograph, you gotta earn it. Start by putting up a decent fight."

;Angel
victory11 = "You're tough, but all that clowning around cost ya. Next time, take me seriously."

;Balrog (Claw)
victory12 = "If your face is so important, maybe you shouldn't show it in public."

;Batsu Ichimonji
victory13 = "Thought you could win on guts alone? You obviously didn't know who you were dealing with!"

;Birdie
victory14 = "You're not a heel, just a glorified jobber!"

;Blanka
victory15 = "It's kinda fun going up against beastly guys like you once in a while."

;Cammy White
victory16 = "Your speed might serve you well on the battlefield, but you won't beat me if that's all you got."

;Casshern
victory17 = "I can read all of your moves, kid. You thought that helmet was gonna save you, huh? Thought wrong!"

;Chun-Li
victory18 = "Your kicks are something else. Did you hone them on the battlefield?"

;Cody Travers
victory19 = "I would've liked to have fought you back when you were just a young scrappy guy on the streets."

;Dan Hibiki
victory20 = "The world's full of people. Some are strong, and some are like you."

;Dhalsim
victory21 = "What the...? How can your arms and legs extend like that?"

;Dudley
victory22 = "A clean fight's all well and good, but there's not much of a point to it if you lose."

;Ed
victory23 = "You have to obtain your own freedom. Seems you already get that, though."

;Elena
victory24 = "Yeah, I had fun, especially with how I felt great after winning."

;F.A.N.G.
victory25 = "You've got height and reach, but you're not making it work for you."

;Falke
victory26 = "Your style reeks of desperation. That doesn't make for a very fun fight."

;Frank West
victory27 = "Cripes, you're one tough customer. Are all cameramen like you?"

;G
victory28 = "President? Pretty sure I never voted for you."

;Gill
victory29 = "Enough talk. Show me your power."

;Gouki
victory30 = "So there are strong fighters out there after all."

;The Griffon Mask
victory31 = "You're built like a mountain with a mask. But I chop mountains down with the edge of my hand."

;Guile
victory32 = "For a so-called army man, you don't fare too well in actual battle."

;E. Honda
victory33 = "Pretty sure you coulda done better. Get back to training, buddy."

;Hugo
victory34 = "I ain't that much of a goofball to just take all of those massive blows."

;Ibuki
victory35 = "You won't get any better if you keep this up. Focus a little more on the fight."

;Juri Han
victory36 = "If you're gonna dish it out, you gotta be ready to take it, too."

;K'
victory37 = "You act like you don't care, but you fight like hell. Guess we ain't that different after all."

;Karin Kanzuki
victory38 = "You're good at putting on the pressure. Catching you was tough."

;Ken Masters
victory39 = "Just what I'd expect from a US martial arts tournament champ. You're in a different league."

;Kolin
victory40 = "Never seen anyone fight like you. Can't tell if you're strong or not..."

;Laura Matsuda
victory41 = "You want me to join your school? Even though I just beat you?"

;Lucia Morgan
victory42 = "Do I like to fight? Yeah... Against strong opponents."

;Luke Sullivan
victory43 = "Unfortunately for you, it takes more than that to defeat me!"

;M. Bison (Boxer)
victory44 = "You make a pretty good heel! I won't hold back when I send you flying!"

;Makoto
victory45 = "So you're the type who rushes in headfirst, huh. Now that's someone who's pretty easy to deal with."

;Menat
victory46 = "Sorry, I don't really buy into astrology or whatever."

;Morrigan Aensland
victory47 = "You're one creepy lady, you know. There ain't gonna be a second date, that's for sure!"

;Charlie Nash
victory48 = "What are those scars on your arm and face? There's no way you got them in that last match."

;Necalli
victory49 = "My soul won't be taken that easily, no matter what you are!"

;Necro
victory50 = "Both freedom and victory are things you earn with your own two hands."

;Oro
victory51 = "I can't afford to get careless with you, otherwise I'm in trouble. That's why I didn't hold back against you."

;Poison
victory52 = "I hope for your sake, you're a better promoter than you are a fighter."

;PTX-40A
victory53 = "Those big guns of yours are strong, but slow. Too bad my fists are lightning fast!"

;Q
victory54 = "I have no clue who you are, but how about you show me that mug of yours?"

;R. Mika
victory55 = "You don't have what it takes to be a face. Not the power, nor the technique."

;Raiden
victory56 = "Can't catch these hands if you can't see 'em, punk!"

;Rashid
victory57 = "You're fast, but your blows are weak. You could hit me a thousand times and still not win."

;Remy
victory58 = "At the end of the day, the only thing to learn from a street fight is who's strong and who's weak."

;Rock Howard
victory59 = "You're fighting to prove something... I respect that. Come find me when you're ready to go all out."

;Rock Volnutt
victory60 = "Sorry, kid. Going easy on ya wouldn't make me much of a man, now would it?"

;Roll
victory61 = "... This girl is like a hardware shop and an armory all rolled into one!"

;Rose
victory62 = "Rough times ahead, huh? Sounds like fun."

;Ryu
victory63 = "You're an interesting one... What is it that your eyes see?"

;Shadow Ryu
victory64 = "You're not weak, but no way would I call you strong."

;Sagat
victory65 = "The thicker the wall, the more satisfying to break through."

;Saki Omokane
victory66 = "Wait, this chick's defending peace on earth? Is this some kind of sick joke?"

;Sakura Kasugano
victory67 = "Well, this is a surprise. Seems like we're both looking for the same guy."

;Sean Matsuda
victory68 = "What happened to all of that vigor you had at the start? I guess you already lost the will to act tough."

;Seth
victory69 = "Data, huh...? Boring."

;Hideyasu 'Soki' Yuki
victory70 = "All that armor to eat attacks you could just dodge. You got your priorities mixed up, buddy."

;Twelve
victory71 = "Are there even more of you guys out there in the world?"

;Urien
victory72 = "Can you still be king or emperor or whatever if you lose this badly?"

;Vega
victory73 = "Fighting you was worth it, but something feels off..."

;Viewtiful Joe
victory74 = "They may call you the hero, but they call me the winner. What do you think about that?"

;Yashiro Nanakase
victory75 = "You can yell, you can flex all day long. But it's not gonna work for me, brother."

;Yang Lee
victory76 = "Logic doesn't show strength. The reason why people lose is because they're weak."

;Yun Lee
victory77 = "It's as clear as day what your eyes are gunning for. Your cap's visor ain't doing much to help here."

;Zangief
victory78 = "If it's a straight up battle of brawn you want, I won't lose!"

;Zeku
victory79 = "Man, I don't get ninjas. All this deception and trickery, when all you have to do is just punch the other guy."

;Zero
victory80 = "Jeebus, I ain't never seen a weapon like that on the streets of Brooklyn!"